Repeat run/qualify for every row listed in plan02/plan.json. Run only after root
reads these tools and authorizes execution. The short future build root is
.build/srx01; preparation does not create it. All seven output destinations,
thirteen run records and qualification outputs must be fresh. A failed or
interrupted record is never overwritten or automatically restarted. The wrapper
