Do not change HEAD, index, canonical source, SDK, tools, original evidence or
baseline artifacts during the frozen campaign. The complete existing exporter
source snapshot is rechecked before/after every operation. Stage/commit exports
only after all thirteen qualifications close. Every unexpected normalized config
change fails for investigation, including otherwise plausible Kconfig changes.
Both each original baseline file and its ignored metadata snapshot are checked
against the same recorded raw byte identity. Every seed and all six Clang
invocation JSON files are pinned before freeze and every later phase; invocation
JSON content must also equal the expected plan row. Actual GCC Ninja dependencies
